{"text":"Day four. The ground shakes again. Not one footstep. Hundreds. A herd of duck-billed dinosaurs comes along the river. Then a deep sound rolls in from far away. You feel it in your chest more than your ears. The herd panics. Trees snap. You throw yourself behind a fallen log. When the dust settles, one of them didn't get up. And it has something you need. A shoulder blade. Flat. Wide. The size of a paddle. From today, your shovel is a dinosaur.","alignment":{"characters":["D","a","y"," ","f","o","u","r","."," ","T","h","e"," ","g","r","o","u","n","d"," ","s","h","a","k","e","s"," ","a","g","a","i","n","."," ","N","o","t"," ","o","n","e"," ","f","o","o","t","s","t","e","p","."," ","H","u","n","d","r","e","d","s","."," ","A"," ","h","e","r","d"," ","o","f"," ","d","u","c","k","-","b","i","l","l","e","d"," ","d","i","n","o","s","a","u","r","s"," ","c","o","m","e","s"," ","a","l","o","n","g"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","a"," ","d","e","e","p"," ","s","o","u","n","d"," ","r","o","l","l","s"," ","i","n"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","f","a","r"," ","a","w","a","y","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","f","e","e","l"," ","i","t"," ","i","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","c","h","e","s","t"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","e","a","r","s","."," ","T","h","e"," ","h","e","r","d"," ","p","a","n","i","c","s","."," ","T","r","e","e","s"," ","s","n","a","p","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","t","h","r","o","w"," ","y","o","u","r","s","e","l","f"," ","b","e","h","i","n","d"," ","a"," ","f","a","l","l","e","n"," ","l","o","g","."," ","W","h","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","u","s","t"," ","s","e","t","t","l","e","s",","," ","o","n","e"," ","o","f"," ","t","h","e","m"," ","d","i","d","n","'","t"," ","g","e","t"," ","u","p","."," ","A","n","d"," ","i","t"," ","h","a","s"," ","s","o","m","e","t","h","i","n","g"," ","y","o","u"," ","n","e","e","d","."," ","A"," ","s","h","o","u","l","d","e","r"," ","b","l","a","d","e","."," ","F","l","a","t"